<v Ira Glass>Our website, thisamericanlife.org. WBEZ management oversight for our program by our boss, Torey Malatia, who has been doing a lot of flamenco dancing-- that's right, flamenco dancing-- on the sly. He sneaks into these fancy parties. He dances a while, until somebody spots him and declares--
<v Ira Glass>我们的网站，thisamericanlife.org。WBEZ管理层对我们节目的监督由我们的老板托雷·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）负责，他一直在偷偷地跳弗拉门戈舞——没错，弗拉门戈舞。他溜进那些高级派对。他跳了一会儿，直到有人发现他并宣布——

00:57:06.790 --> 00:57:09.390
<v Viridiana Martinez>[SPEAKING SPANISH]
<v Viridiana Martinez>（西班牙语）

00:57:09.390 --> 00:57:12.340
<v Viridiana Martinez>They're like, the infiltrator.
<v Viridiana Martinez>他们说，那个渗透者。

00:57:12.340 --> 00:57:15.950
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of this American life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多关于美国生活的故事回来。

